msgstr "确认强制解绑"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to unbind <strong>%(name)s</strong> (AA username "
"%(username)s) from QQ <strong class=\"font-monospace\">%(qq)s</strong>?"
msgstr ""
"你确定要解除 <strong>%(name)s</strong>（AA 用户名 %(username)s） 和 QQ <strong "
"class=\"font-monospace\">%(qq)s</strong> 的绑定吗？"

msgid ""
"After unbinding, this QQ no longer counts as an alliance member. The bot "
"will re-check it and may stop approving it or remove it from managed groups."
msgstr "解绑后，这个 QQ 就不再算作联盟成员，机器人会复查它，可能不再批准它入群，也可能把它移出受管的群。"

msgid "This is recorded in the audit log. The member can bind again later."
msgstr "这个操作会写进操作记录。对方以后可以重新绑定。"

msgid "Back, don't unbind"
msgstr "返回，不解绑"

msgid "Search"
msgstr "搜索"

msgid "Username, character, QQ number or corporation ticker"
msgstr "用户名、角色名、QQ 号或军团简称"

msgid "Conflicts only"
msgstr "只看冲突"

msgid "Clear filters"
msgstr "清除条件"

#, python-format
msgid "%(counter)s binding found."
msgid_plural "%(counter)s bindings found."
msgstr[0] "共找到 %(counter)s 条绑定。"

msgid "User / main character"
msgstr "用户 / 主角色"

msgid "Allowed groups"
msgstr "可进的群"

msgid "Inactive"
msgstr "已停用"

msgid "Set by manager"
msgstr "管理员指定"

msgid "No matching bindings found."
msgstr "没有找到符合条件的绑定。"

msgid "Delete group"
msgstr "删除群"

msgid "Confirm group deletion"
msgstr "确认删除群"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to delete the group <strong>%(name)s</strong> (<span "
"class=\"font-monospace\">%(group_id)s</span>)?"
msgstr ""
"你确定要删除群 <strong>%(name)s</strong>（<span class=\"font-"
"monospace\">%(group_id)s</span>）吗？"

msgid ""
"After deletion the bot stops managing this group, and members no longer see "
"it in the QQ binding card on the Services page."
msgstr "删除后，机器人不再管理这个群，成员在「服务」页的 QQ 绑定卡片里也看不到它了。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The member list the bot reported for this group (%(counter)s member) is "
"deleted too."
msgid_plural ""
"The member list the bot reported for this group (%(counter)s members) is "
"deleted too."
msgstr[0] "机器人上报的这个群的成员名单（%(counter)s 人）也会一起删除。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"If you only need to pause it, <a href=\"%(edit_url)s\">edit</a> it and "
"untick \"Enabled\" instead; you can turn it back on later."
msgstr "如果只是暂时不用，建议改为<a href=\"%(edit_url)s\">编辑</a>并取消「启用」，以后还能恢复。"

msgid "Confirm delete"
msgstr "确认删除"

msgid "Back, don't delete"
msgstr "返回，不删除"

msgid "Edit group"
msgstr "编辑群"

msgid "Add group"
msgstr "添加群"

#, python-format
msgid "Edit group: %(name)s"
msgstr "编辑群：%(name)s"

msgid "Not saved: fix the fields marked in red below, then save again."
msgstr "没有保存：请按照下面红色的提示修改后再保存。"

msgid "Save"
msgstr "保存"

msgid "Back, don't save"
msgstr "返回，不保存"

msgid "Managed QQ groups"
msgstr "受管的 QQ 群"

msgid ""
"The bot only manages groups listed here that are \"Enabled\". Any member can"
" join a <strong>Fixed group</strong>; only people in the selected AA groups "
"can join a <strong>Role group</strong>."
msgstr ""
"机器人只管理这里列出并且「启用」的群。<strong>固定群</strong>所有成员都能加入；<strong>身份组小群</strong>只有所选 "
"AA 组里的人能加入。"

msgid "Member list"
msgstr "名单"

msgid "None selected (please edit)"
msgstr "未选择（请编辑）"

msgid "All members"
msgstr "所有成员"

#, python-format
msgid "%(counter)s member"
msgid_plural "%(counter)s members"
msgstr[0] "%(counter)s 人"

msgid " (outdated)"
msgstr "（已过期）"

msgid "Not reported by the bot yet"
msgstr "机器人还没上报"

msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "启用"

msgctxt "qqbot"
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "停用"

msgid "Edit"
msgstr "编辑"

msgid "Delete"
msgstr "删除"

msgid "No groups added yet. Click \"Add group\" at the top right to start."
msgstr "还没有添加任何群。点右上角的「添加群」开始。"

msgid ""
"Two or more accounts claim the same QQ as \"Trusted (already in group)\". "
"The bot neither kicks nor rejects a conflicting QQ; it waits for you to "
"decide who owns it. First check who the real owner is (for example, by "
"messaging them on QQ), then click \"Confirm as owner\" on their row; the "
"other claims are cancelled automatically. If none of them is right, force-"
"unbind the wrong one. (While the owner is still in the group, this QQ cannot"
" get a verification code, so conflicts can only be resolved here.)"
msgstr ""
"同一个 QQ 被两个或更多账号以「老成员免验证」认领。机器人对冲突的 QQ 不会踢人也不会拒绝，只等你来决定归谁。 请先核实谁是真正的号主（例如在 QQ"
" 上私聊确认），然后点他那一行的「确认归他」，其他账号的认领会自动作废； 如果都不对，可以把错误的一方强制解绑。 （号主还在群里时，这个 QQ "
"拿不到验证码，所以冲突只能在这里处理。）"

#, python-format
msgid "%(counter)s account claims it"
msgid_plural "%(counter)s accounts claim it"
msgstr[0] "%(counter)s 个账号认领"

msgid "Nickname / group nickname"
msgstr "昵称 / 群名片"

msgid "Claimed at"
msgstr "认领时间"

msgid "Confirm as owner"
msgstr "确认归他"

#, python-format
msgid "Bound without a code in the last %(days)s day"
msgid_plural "Bound without a code in the last %(days)s days"
msgstr[0] "最近 %(days)s 天的免验证绑定"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"These members entered a QQ from a group member list and were bound without a "
"verification code (\"Trusted (already in group)\"). During the transition "
"window anyone can claim any QQ in the group this way, so take a quick look: "
"is the main character the same person as that QQ in the group? If yes, click "
"\"Confirm as owner\" (the binding becomes verified and leaves this list). If "
"not, force-unbind it. Bindings you leave alone keep working and drop off "
"this list after %(days)s day."
msgid_plural ""
"These members entered a QQ from a group member list and were bound without a "
"verification code (\"Trusted (already in group)\"). During the transition "
"window anyone can claim any QQ in the group this way, so take a quick look: "
"is the main character the same person as that QQ in the group? If yes, click "
"\"Confirm as owner\" (the binding becomes verified and leaves this list). If "
"not, force-unbind it. Bindings you leave alone keep working and drop off "
"this list after %(days)s days."
msgstr[0] ""
"这些成员填写的 QQ 在群成员名单里，没用验证码就绑定了（「老成员免验证」）。"
"过渡期内，任何人都可以这样认领群里的任意一个 QQ，所以请看一眼：主角色和群里"
"这个 QQ 是同一个人吗？是的话点「确认归他」（绑定变成「已验证」，从这里消失）；"
"不是的话就强制解绑。不处理的绑定照常生效，%(days)s 天后从这里消失。"

msgid "In groups"
msgstr "所在的群"

msgid "Nothing to review."
msgstr "没有需要复核的绑定。"

msgid "No conflicts right now."
msgstr "现在没有冲突。"

msgid "QQ numbers in a group but not bound"
msgstr "群里有、但没有绑定的 QQ"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"From the member lists the bot last reported (within %(days)s day). These QQ "
"numbers are in the group, but no AA account is bound to them yet. You can "
"remind them to bind in the QQ binding card on AA's Services page; for "
"existing members the binding takes effect as soon as they enter their QQ, "
"with no verification code."
msgid_plural ""
"From the member lists the bot last reported (within %(days)s days). These QQ"
" numbers are in the group, but no AA account is bound to them yet. You can "
"remind them to bind in the QQ binding card on AA's Services page; for "
"existing members the binding takes effect as soon as they enter their QQ, "
"with no verification code."
msgstr[0] ""
"来自机器人最近一次（%(days)s 天以内）上报的群成员名单。这些 QQ 在群里，但还没有任何 AA 账号绑定它们。 可以提醒他们到 AA「服务」页的"
" QQ 绑定卡片里绑定；老成员填写 QQ 后会直接生效，不需要验证码。"

#, python-format
msgid "%(counter)s QQ"
msgid_plural "%(counter)s QQs"
msgstr[0] "%(counter)s 个"

#, python-format
msgid "List reported at %(reported_at)s"
msgstr "名单上报于 %(reported_at)s"

msgid "No unbound QQ numbers found."
msgstr "没有发现未绑定的 QQ。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The member lists of these groups have not been updated for more than "
"%(days)s day (or the bot has never reported them), so they are not listed. "
"Check that the bot is running its regular checks:"
msgid_plural ""
"The member lists of these groups have not been updated for more than "
"%(days)s days (or the bot has never reported them), so they are not listed. "
"Check that the bot is running its regular checks:"
msgstr[0] "下面这些群的成员名单超过 %(days)s 天没有更新（或机器人还没上报过），所以没有列出。请检查机器人是否在正常巡检："

#, python-format
msgid "%(name)s (<span class=\"font-monospace\">%(group_id)s</span>)"
msgstr "%(name)s（<span class=\"font-monospace\">%(group_id)s</span>）"

#, python-format
msgid ": last reported at %(reported_at)s"
msgstr "：最近一次上报于 %(reported_at)s"

msgid ": not reported yet"
msgstr "：还没有上报"

msgid ""
"The group nickname format can use these placeholders (write them exactly as "
"shown, braces included):"
msgstr "群名片格式可以使用这些占位符（照原样写，包括大括号）："

msgid "corporation ticker"
msgstr "军团简称"

msgid "alliance ticker"
msgstr "联盟简称"

msgid "main character name"
msgstr "主角色名"

msgid "nickname entered by the member"
msgstr "成员填写的昵称"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"With the current format, your own group nickname would be: <strong "
"id=\"qqbot-example-card\">%(example_card)s</strong>. A group nickname is at "
"most 60 bytes; if it is too long, the character name is shortened first. "
"After you change the format, everyone's group nickname is recalculated in "
"the background and the bot then updates them automatically."
msgstr ""
"按现在的格式，你自己的群名片会是：<strong id=\"qqbot-example-"
"card\">%(example_card)s</strong>。 群名片最长 60 "
"字节，超长时会先缩短角色名。修改格式后，所有人的群名片会在后台重新计算，机器人随后会自动改名片。"

msgid "Save settings"
msgstr "保存设置"

msgid ""
"Group nickname (the first part is generated for you; enter only your "
