"the character name is shortened automatically."
msgstr[0] "昵称最多写 %(cjk)s 个汉字（或 %(ascii)s 个英文字母、数字）才能完整显示角色名；再长的话，角色名会被自动缩短。"

msgid "Your character name is shortened automatically."
msgstr "再长的话，角色名会被自动缩短。"

msgid "Fixed groups"
msgstr "固定群"

msgid "Role groups"
msgstr "身份组小群"

msgid ""
"The verification code you got for changing QQ has expired (timed out or "
