msgstr "显示在群号旁边的一句话，可以不填。"

msgid "Lower numbers are listed first."
msgstr "数字越小越靠前。"

msgid ""
"When unticked, members don't see this group and the bot stops managing it."
msgstr "取消勾选后，成员看不到这个群，机器人也不再管理它。"

msgid ""
"Only for role groups: anyone in any of these groups can join. Leave empty "
"for a fixed group."
msgstr "只有身份组小群需要选择：属于其中任意一个组的人就可以加入。固定群请不要选择。"

