msgid "Invalid group number: %(hint)s"
msgstr "群号格式不正确：%(hint)s"

msgid ""
"A role group needs at least one AA group, otherwise nobody can join it."
msgstr "身份组小群至少要选择一个 AA 组，否则谁都进不了这个群。"

msgid ""
"A fixed group is open to every member and needs no AA groups. If this group "
"is only for certain groups, change the type to \"Role group\"; otherwise "
"untick all groups."
msgstr "固定群对所有成员开放，不需要选择 AA 组。如果这个群只给特定组的人，请把类型改成「身份组小群」；否则请取消勾选所有组。"

